-- Hyathlon: upper-body rehab frameworks (8), DRAFT for physio review.
-- Adds 24 exercises, 8 rehab programs (24 phases, 149 exercise rows) and 1 guidance item(s).
-- All new programs are review_status 'Draft', so athletes can't see them until approved.
-- Existing running frameworks are not changed, except the shared disclaimer now says "training injuries".
-- Contains no personal data.
set local search_path = public, extensions;



-- Shared disclaimer: training injuries
alter table public.rehab_programs alter column disclaimer set default 'Not medical advice. This section shares general considerations and example exercises commonly used for training injuries. It is not a diagnosis or a treatment plan. Always follow the advice of your doctor, physiotherapist or other medical professional, who can assess you individually. If you''re unsure about anything, check with them first.';
update public.rehab_programs set disclaimer = 'Not medical advice. This section shares general considerations and example exercises commonly used for training injuries. It is not a diagnosis or a treatment plan. Always follow the advice of your doctor, physiotherapist or other medical professional, who can assess you individually. If you''re unsure about anything, check with them first.';
update public.rehab_global_guidance set items = array['Not medical advice. This section shares general considerations and example exercises commonly used for training injuries. It is not a diagnosis or a treatment plan. Always follow the advice of your doctor, physiotherapist or other medical professional, who can assess you individually. If you''re unsure about anything, check with them first.']::text[] where key = 'disclaimer';





